  'App-specific': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Short UI label or navigation item. Seen in: page solutions/production-updates.astro. Message key `solutions_benefit3_stat_value` (Solutions Benefit3 Stat Value).',
  'app-specific password': 'HTML text fragment from a longer Capgo UI string (parent key `appflow_credentials_desc`). Page/area: Appflow comparison / migration marketing copy. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `appflow_credentials_desc` (Appflow Credentials Desc).',
  'Appflow approach:': 'Page/area: Appflow comparison / migration marketing copy. Role: UI label. Seen in: page ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `appflow_credentials_appflow_label` (Appflow Credentials Appflow Label).',
  'Appflow bundled live updates, CI/CD, and native builds. Capgo focuses on the live-update system itself: automatic setup in 5 minutes when you want the easy path, plus manual and half-manual flows when your release logic is more advanced.': 'Page/area: Appflow comparison / migration marketing copy. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `appflow_focus_desc` (Appflow Focus Desc).',
  'AppFlow Migration Ready': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page solutions/version-targeting.astro. Message key `solutions_version_targeting_feature3_title` (Solutions Version Targeting Feature3 Title).',
  'AppFlow or similar': 'Page/area: Appflow comparison / migration marketing copy. Role: Short UI label or navigation item. Message key `appflow_or_similar` (Appflow Or Similar).',
  'Appflow stores your Apple ID and app-specific password to upload binaries. Capgo uses App Store Connect API keys (.p8): scoped, revocable, and independent of personal Apple ID password changes. For cloud builds, credentials are only used in ephemeral environments — not parked on a vendor server indefinitely.': 'Page/area: Appflow comparison / migration marketing copy. Role: FAQ question or answer. Seen in: page ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `appflow_faq_a5` (Appflow FAQ A5).',
  'AppFlow tied bundles to native versions automatically. With Capgo, you get the same behavior with more flexibility:': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/version-targeting.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_version_targeting_appflow_desc` (Solutions Version Targeting Appflow Desc).',
  'AppFlow Users: Here\'s Your Migration Path': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page solutions/version-targeting.astro. Message key `solutions_version_targeting_appflow_title` (Solutions Version Targeting Appflow Title).',
  'Appflow was great if you wanted everything in one place - CI/CD, live updates, native builds - and had the budget for it.': 'Page/area: Capacitor live-update alternatives comparison page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page alternatives.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `alternatives_appflow_when_good` (Alternatives Appflow When Good).',
  'Appflow was the expensive default. Capgo is the original independent, open-source path for Capacitor live updates, with deeper controls and proven scale.': 'Page/area: Appflow comparison / migration marketing copy. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Seen in: page ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `appflow_hero_subtitle` (Appflow Hero Subtitle).',
  'Appflow:': 'HTML text fragment from a longer Capgo UI string (parent key `appflow_pricing_comparison`). Page/area: Appflow comparison / migration marketing copy. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `appflow_pricing_comparison` (Appflow Pricing Comparison).',
  'Appflow: <strong class="text-rose-400">$499/month</strong> minimum<br>Capgo: <strong class="text-emerald-400">$12/month</strong> to start, scales with usage': 'Page/area: Appflow comparison / migration marketing copy. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `appflow_pricing_comparison` (Appflow Pricing Comparison).',
  'Appflow: $499/month minimum Capgo: $12/month to start, scales with usage': 'Page/area: Appflow comparison / migration marketing copy. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `appflow_pricing_comparison` (Appflow Pricing Comparison).',
  'Appflow\'s Apple destination docs': 'HTML text fragment from a longer Capgo UI string (parent key `appflow_credentials_note`). Page/area: Appflow comparison / migration marketing copy. Role: Supporting note or footnote. Seen in: page ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `appflow_credentials_note` (Appflow Credentials Note).',
  'Appflow\'s Apple destination docs list an app-specific password as a required field. Capgo Builder follows Apple\'s API-key model instead.': 'Page/area: Appflow comparison / migration marketing copy. Role: Supporting note or footnote. Seen in: page ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `appflow_credentials_note` (Appflow Credentials Note).',
  'Apple account setup': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section or page heading. Message key `solutions_build_without_mac_normal1_title` (Solutions Build Without Mac Normal1 Title).',
  'Apple and Google can take anywhere from 24 hours to a week to approve your update. During critical bugs, every hour matters.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/production-updates.astro. Message key `solutions_review_time_explanation` (Solutions Review Time Explanation).',
  'Apple ID + invitation': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Short UI label or navigation item. Seen in: page solutions/pr-preview.astro. Message key `solutions_pr_compare_setup_tf` (Solutions Pr Compare Setup Tf).',
