  'Before Capgo, serious Capacitor live updates mostly meant Appflow. We built the independent path, and we\'re still the most complete and flexible option for teams that need control.': 'Page/area: Capacitor live-update alternatives comparison page. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Seen in: page alternatives.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `alternatives_hero_subtitle` (Alternatives Hero Subtitle).',
  'Before Capgo, their process involved emergency weekend work, expedited App Store review requests (which Apple often ignores), and four days of user complaints. Their support team logged 340 tickets. Three users closed their accounts.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/production-updates.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_scenario_para2` (Solutions Scenario Para2).',
