  'Capawesome: No dynamic channel assignment - channels are static. You cannot reassign devices to different channels without shipping a new app version.': 'Page/area: Capawesome comparison page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page capwesome.astro. Message key `capwesome_diff_channels_capawesome` (Capwesome Diff Channels Capawesome).',
  'Capawesome: Plugin, CLI is open source, backend is 0% open source (fully closed)': 'Page/area: Capawesome comparison page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page capwesome.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `capwesome_diff_opensource_capawesome` (Capwesome Diff Opensource Capawesome).',
