  'Capgo not only has incredibly talented engineers, but they also share my passion for project success. Having a true partner has been a wonderful experience, and it allows us to move much faster than we could alone.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page consulting.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `testimonial_consulting` (Testimonial Consulting).',
  'Capgo over-the-air updates included': 'Page/area: Capgo Builder / native cloud build product page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page native-build.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `native_build_v2_plan_ota` (Native Build V2 Plan OTA).',
