  'Capgo PR Preview': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Short UI label or navigation item. Seen in: page solutions/pr-preview.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_pr_compare_capgo` (Solutions Pr Compare Capgo).',
  'Capgo Privacy Policy - Learn how we protect your data and respect user privacy in our live update service for Capacitor apps.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Supporting description paragraph or meta description. Seen in: page privacy.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `read_our_privacy_policy_description` (Read Our Privacy Policy Description).',
  'Capgo protects your release pipeline with independent audits, hardened infrastructure, and processes designed for fast, safe shipping.': 'Page/area: Trust / security / compliance page. Role: Supporting description paragraph or meta description. Seen in: page trust.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `trust_hero_description` (Trust Hero Description).',
  'Capgo provides Support Service Level Agreements for our Team and Enterprise customers.': 'Page/area: Support / premium support page or footer support section. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page sla.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `support_desc` (Support Desc).',
  'Capgo QR path': 'Page/area: Capgo Builder / native cloud build product page. Role: UI label. Seen in: page native-build.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `native_build_v2_share_vs_new_label` (Native Build V2 Share Vs New Label).',
  'Capgo release loop': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page solutions/lovable-vibecoding-to-mobile.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_lovable_to_mobile_flow3_title` (Solutions Lovable To Mobile Flow3 Title).',
  'Capgo relies on trusted third-party subprocessors to provide, secure, and improve the service. The list below describes the vendors and how they are used.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `subprocessors_intro` (Subprocessors Intro).',
  'Capgo returns a download URL and QR. Persist it with --output-record for PR comments.': 'Page/area: Capgo Builder / native cloud build product page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page native-build.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `native_build_v2_share_step2_d` (Native Build V2 Share Step2 D).',
  'Capgo separates the rare binary problem from the daily product problem. Native builds get signed in the cloud; web changes keep moving through live updates.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/build-without-mac.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_build_without_mac_cap_lead` (Solutions Build Without Mac Cap Lead).',
  'Capgo shall assist the controller in complying with the obligations concerning the security of personal data. Capgo will also provide assistance to the controller for DPIAs. Where a data subject asserts their rights as a data subject, this request will be forwarded to the controller without delay.': 'Page/area: Data Processing Agreement legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dpa.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `dpa_processor_obligations_9` (DPA Processor Obligations 9).',
  'Capgo shall guarantee the confidentiality of service data processed hereunder.': 'Page/area: Data Processing Agreement legal page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page dpa.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `dpa_processor_obligations_3` (DPA Processor Obligations 3).',
  'Capgo shall implement and maintain appropriate technical and organisational security measures designed to protect the service data against unauthorised or unlawful processing and against accidental loss, destruction, damage, theft, alteration or disclosure. These measures shall be appropriate to the harm which might result from any unauthorised or unlawful processing, accidental loss, destruction, damage or theft of the service data and having regard to the nature of the service data which is to be protected.': 'Page/area: Data Processing Agreement legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dpa.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `dpa_processor_obligations_5` (DPA Processor Obligations 5).',
  'Capgo shall not on its own authority rectify, erase or restrict the processing of service data that is being processed on behalf of the controller (unless this is required by law or the Processor Terms of Service), but shall only do so on documented instructions from the controller and in accordance to the data retention rules associated to the controller subscription plan.': 'Page/area: Data Processing Agreement legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dpa.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `dpa_processor_obligations_8` (DPA Processor Obligations 8).',
  'Capgo shall notify customer without undue delay if, in Capgo\'s opinion, an instruction for the processing of service data given by customer infringes applicable Data Protection Legislation.': 'Page/area: Data Processing Agreement legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dpa.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `dpa_processor_obligations_2` (DPA Processor Obligations 2).',
  'Capgo signs and encrypts bundles end-to-end so only your app can read what you ship.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `only_your_users_can_decrypt_your_updates_no_one_else` (Only Your Users Can Decrypt Your Updates No One Else).',
