  'Capgo Sponsors': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page sponsor.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `sponsor_title` (Sponsor Title).',
  'Capgo started the independent Capacitor live-update category in 2020; they launched live updates in 2024': 'HTML text fragment from a longer Capgo UI string (parent key `alternatives_capawesome_diff_experience`). Page/area: Capacitor live-update alternatives comparison page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page alternatives.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `alternatives_capawesome_diff_experience` (Alternatives Capawesome Diff Experience).',
  'Capgo stores all your app configuration in the cloud with global data replication. Change a setting in the dashboard, and it takes effect worldwide in under 2 minutes. No app store updates, no waiting.': 'Page/area: Live updates product page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `live_update_cloud_config_desc` (Live Update Cloud Config Desc).',
  'Capgo support staff will only address requests received through these official channels. Community channels may exist for peer-to-peer support and discussions, provided by volunteers contributing to the Capgo community.': 'Page/area: Support / premium support page or footer support section. Role: Supporting note or footnote. Seen in: page support-policy.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `support_policy_official_channels_note` (Support Policy Official Channels Note).',
  'Capgo team': 'Page/area: Enterprise product/pricing page. Role: UI label. Seen in: page enterprise.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `enterprise_partnership_capgo_team_label` (Enterprise Partnership Capgo Team Label).',
