  'Capgo turns live updates into a production release system.': 'Page/area: Live updates product page. Role: Section or page heading. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `live_update_proof_title` (Live Update Proof Title).',
  'Capgo updates JavaScript, HTML, CSS, and assets. Native plugin changes still require a new signed native package.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/set-and-forget.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_set_and_forget_boundary_2` (Solutions Set And Forget Boundary 2).',
  'Capgo User since 2023': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Supporting description paragraph or meta description. Seen in: component HowItWorks.astro, page register.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `testimonial_description` (Testimonial Description).',
  'Capgo uses a randomly generated, app-scoped device identifier for live-update operation, update eligibility, de-duplication of monthly active devices, support, abuse prevention, and operational reliability. It is not an advertising ID, is not derived from hardware identifiers, and is not used to track users across apps, websites, or Capgo customers. We treat this identifier as pseudonymous personal data where GDPR applies and protect it through TLS, encryption at rest, access controls, and our DPA/subprocessor controls.': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dp.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `data_policy_no_persistent_identifier` (Data Policy No Persistent Identifier). | Page/area: Data Processing Agreement legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dpa.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `dpa_privacy_security_6` (DPA Privacy Security 6).',
  'Capgo vs Basic Update Systems': 'Page/area: Live updates product page. Role: Section or page heading. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `live_update_comparison_title` (Live Update Comparison Title).',
  'Capgo vs Capawesome Cloud': 'Page/area: Capawesome comparison page. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page capwesome.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `capwesome_hero_title` (Capwesome Hero Title).',
  'Capgo was born from a real need in the developer community.': 'Page/area: Capgo brand/product marketing copy. Role: Website copy sentence. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `capgo_was_born_from_a_real_need_in_the_developer_community` (Capgo Was Born From A Real Need In The Developer Community).',
  'Capgo was built to make that workflow independent: open source, affordable, focused on live updates, and flexible enough for teams that need more than the basic Appflow path.': 'Page/area: Appflow comparison / migration marketing copy. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `appflow_credit_p2` (Appflow Credit P2).',
  'Capgo will process service data only in accordance with instructions from customer through the settings of the service, i.e. (a) to operate, maintain and support the infrastructure used to provide the service; (b) to comply with customer\'s instructions and processing instructions in their use, management and administration of the service; (c) as otherwise instructed through settings of the service. Capgo will only process service data in accordance with the agreement.': 'Page/area: Data Processing Agreement legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dpa.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `dpa_processor_obligations_1` (DPA Processor Obligations 1).',
  'Capgo will provide Actual Availability for at least ninety-nine percent (99.9%) of the total time in each calendar month during the Subscription Term, as measured by Capgo (the "Uptime Commitment").': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page sla.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `uptime_commitment_desc` (Uptime Commitment Desc).',
