  'Capgo: $12/month to start, scales with usage (~$0.001/MAU). Live updates is our core business.': 'Page/area: Capawesome comparison page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page capwesome.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `capwesome_diff_pricing_capgo` (Capwesome Diff Pricing Capgo).',
  'Capgo: 100% open source - plugin AND backend (MIT/MPL-2.0)': 'Page/area: Capawesome comparison page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page capwesome.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `capwesome_diff_opensource_capgo` (Capwesome Diff Opensource Capgo).',
  'Capgo: Bootstrapped family business . No investors, no debt. Profitable since year one.': 'Page/area: Capawesome comparison page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page capwesome.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `capwesome_diff_business_capgo` (Capwesome Diff Business Capgo).',
  'Capgo: Device-level logs - see exactly what happened on each device. Update history, errors, rollbacks - all traceable per device with anonymous IDs.': 'Page/area: Capawesome comparison page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page capwesome.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `capwesome_diff_logs_capgo` (Capwesome Diff Logs Capgo).',
  'Capgo: Dynamic channel assignment - assign devices to channels via API, from your backend, or let devices self-assign . Use cases: A/B testing, beta programs, gradual rollouts, per-location builds (different bundles per restaurant/store), PR preview testing - all without shipping new app versions.': 'Page/area: Capawesome comparison page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page capwesome.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `capwesome_diff_channels_capgo` (Capwesome Diff Channels Capgo).',
  'Capgo: Started in 2020. Serving 1B+ updates/month across 50M+ devices . Battle-tested at scale for 4+ years.': 'Page/area: Capawesome comparison page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page capwesome.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `capwesome_diff_experience_capgo` (Capwesome Diff Experience Capgo).',
  'Capgo: Usually within hours, often minutes. Even on weekends (we can\'t help ourselves 😅)': 'Page/area: Capawesome comparison page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page capwesome.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `capwesome_diff_support_capgo` (Capwesome Diff Support Capgo).',
  'Capgo: We maintain {pluginCountLabel} Capacitor plugins - biggest provider after official Capacitor team. All free and open source.': 'Page/area: Capawesome comparison page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page capwesome.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `capwesome_diff_plugins_capgo` (Capwesome Diff Plugins Capgo).',
