  'Do not ask for status updates such as "have you checked?" or similar questions. Once we confirm we received your report, that is enough. After that, there is still significant work to do, and preparing a pull request can take several days.': 'Page/area: Bug bounty program page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page bug-bounty.astro. Message key `bug_bounty_conduct_rule_5` (Bug Bounty Conduct Rule 5).',
  'Do not run automated scanners on other customer projects. Running automated scanners can run up costs for our users. Aggressively configured scanners might inadvertently disrupt services, exploit vulnerabilities, lead to system instability or breaches and violate Terms of Service from our upstream providers. Our own security systems won\'t be able to distinguish hostile reconnaissance from whitehat research. If you wish to run an automated scanner, notify us at security@capgo.app and only run it on your own Capgo project. Do NOT attack projects of other customers.': 'Page/area: Security documentation or trust copy. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page security.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `security_testing_guidelines_1` (Security Testing Guidelines 1).',
  'Do not spam us. More than three emails in a single day is considered spam and will be blocked.': 'Page/area: Bug bounty program page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page bug-bounty.astro. Message key `bug_bounty_conduct_rule_2` (Bug Bounty Conduct Rule 2).',
  'Do not take advantage of the vulnerability or problem you have discovered, for example by downloading more data than necessary to demonstrate the vulnerability or deleting or modifying other people\'s data.': 'Page/area: Security documentation or trust copy. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page security.astro. Message key `security_testing_guidelines_2` (Security Testing Guidelines 2).',
