  'enterprise SLA handling for critical production incidents.': 'Page/area: Enterprise product/pricing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page enterprise.astro. Message key `enterprise_partnership_p1_desc` (Enterprise Partnership P1 Desc).',
