  'Enterprise Support': 'Page/area: Enterprise product/pricing page. Role: Short UI label or navigation item. Message key `enterprise_support` (Enterprise Support).',
  'Enterprise support is not a ticket queue. You get a named account owner, a private Slack or Teams channel with the people building Capgo, P1 incident handling, and scoped engineering help when your roadmap needs platform work.': 'Page/area: Enterprise product/pricing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page enterprise.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `enterprise_partnership_desc` (Enterprise Partnership Desc).',
  'Enterprise teams do not need another speed promise. They need a release path that keeps urgent changes moving while security, support, finance, and platform owners still have control.': 'Page/area: Enterprise product/pricing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page enterprise.astro. Message key `enterprise_pain_desc` (Enterprise Pain Desc).',
