  'Error tracking and delivery stats show when to pause, retry, or roll back a release.': 'Page/area: Homepage landing product feature section. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: component landing/MonitoringFeatures.astro. Message key `landing_monitoring_updates_desc` (Landing Monitoring Updates Desc).',
  'Errors and Omissions Disclaimer': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page disclaimer.astro. Message key `errors_and_omissions_disclaimer_title` (Errors And Omissions Disclaimer Title).',
