  'Example stack': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: UI label. Seen in: page solutions/lovable-vibecoding-to-mobile.astro. Message key `solutions_lovable_to_mobile_example_label` (Solutions Lovable To Mobile Example Label).',
