  'Examples use current list prices and 20% of each invoice. Yearly columns use annual billing, which is discounted versus 12 monthly invoices.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Supporting note or footnote. Seen in: page affiliate.astro. Message key `affiliate_examples_note` (Affiliate Examples Note).',
  'Examples: A name, signature, Social Security number, physical characteristics or description, address, telephone number, passport number, driver\'s license or state identification card number, insurance policy number, education, employment, employment history, bank account number, credit card number, debit card number, or any other financial information, medical information, or health insurance information. Some personal information included in this category may overlap with other categories.': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dp.astro. Message key `data_policy_ccpa_category_b_examples` (Data Policy CCPA Category B Examples).',
  'Examples: A real name, alias, postal address, unique personal identifier, online identifier, Internet Protocol address, email address, account name, driver\'s license number, passport number, or other similar identifiers.': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dp.astro. Message key `data_policy_ccpa_category_a_examples` (Data Policy CCPA Category A Examples).',
  'Examples: Age (40 years or older), race, color, ancestry, national origin, citizenship, religion or creed, marital status, medical condition, physical or mental disability, sex (including gender, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy or childbirth and related medical conditions), sexual orientation, veteran or military status, genetic information (including familial genetic information).': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dp.astro. Message key `data_policy_ccpa_category_c_examples` (Data Policy CCPA Category C Examples).',
  'Examples: Approximate physical location.': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page dp.astro. Message key `data_policy_ccpa_category_g_examples` (Data Policy CCPA Category G Examples).',
  'Examples: Audio, electronic, visual, thermal, olfactory, or similar information.': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page dp.astro. Message key `data_policy_ccpa_category_h_examples` (Data Policy CCPA Category H Examples).',
  'Examples: Current or past job history or performance evaluations.': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page dp.astro. Message key `data_policy_ccpa_category_i_examples` (Data Policy CCPA Category I Examples).',
  'Examples: Education records directly related to a student maintained by an educational institution or party acting on its behalf, such as grades, transcripts, class lists, student schedules, student identification codes, student financial information, or student disciplinary records.': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dp.astro. Message key `data_policy_ccpa_category_j_examples` (Data Policy CCPA Category J Examples).',
  'Examples: Genetic, physiological, behavioral, and biological characteristics, or activity patterns used to extract a template or other identifier or identifying information, such as, fingerprints, faceprints, and voiceprints, iris or retina scans, keystroke, gait, or other physical patterns, and sleep, health, or exercise data.': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dp.astro. Message key `data_policy_ccpa_category_e_examples` (Data Policy CCPA Category E Examples).',
  'Examples: Interaction with our Service or advertisement.': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page dp.astro. Message key `data_policy_ccpa_category_f_examples` (Data Policy CCPA Category F Examples).',
  'Examples: Profile reflecting a person\'s preferences, characteristics, psychological trends, predispositions, behavior, attitudes, intelligence, abilities, and aptitudes.': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dp.astro. Message key `data_policy_ccpa_category_k_examples` (Data Policy CCPA Category K Examples).',
  'Examples: Records and history of products or services purchased or considered.': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page dp.astro. Message key `data_policy_ccpa_category_d_examples` (Data Policy CCPA Category D Examples).',
