  'Except when required by law, paid Subscription fees are non-refundable.': 'Page/area: Terms of Service legal page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page tos.astro. Message key `tos_subscriptions_refunds_text_1` (Terms of Service Subscriptions Refunds Text 1).',
  'Except when required by law, paid subscription fees are non-refundable. However, certain refund requests may be considered on a case-by-case basis and granted at the sole discretion of Capgo. If you believe you qualify for a refund, please contact our support team.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: component pricing/Faq.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `do_you_offer_refunds_answer` (Do You Offer Refunds Answer).',
