  'Imprint': 'Legal imprint page navigation label (company disclosure). Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Short UI label or navigation item. Seen in: site footer, page imprint.astro. Message key `imprint` (Imprint).',
  'Improve screen reader behavior, focus order, and touch targets. Validate with real devices.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Message key `solutions_cordova_to_capacitor_day8_desc` (Solutions Cordova To Capacitor Day8 Desc).',
  'Improve templates through live updates': 'Page/area: Solution page app examples section. Role: Bullet list item. Message key `solution_app_examples_lovable_vibecoding_to_mobile_play_3` (Solution App Examples Lovable Vibecoding To Mobile Play 3).',
  'Improvement in Day-1 retention': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/direct-updates.astro. Message key `solutions_direct_benefit3_stat` (Solutions Direct Benefit3 Stat).',
  'In any case, the Company will gladly help to clarify the specific legal basis that applies to the processing, and in particular whether the provision of Personal Data is a statutory or contractual requirement, or a requirement necessary to enter into a contract.': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dp.astro. Message key `data_policy_legal_basis_clarification` (Data Policy Legal Basis Clarification).',
  'in background mode, this is usually invisible to users. In direct mode, the service may return a 5xx response when reachable; if the server is simply too slow, the plugin waits up to 3 seconds, cancels the query, and continues normal app startup.': 'HTML text fragment from a longer Capgo UI string (parent key `support_policy_service_disruption_if_capgo_down`). Page/area: Support / premium support page or footer support section. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page support-policy.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `support_policy_service_disruption_if_capgo_down` (Support Policy Service Disruption If Capgo Down).',
  'In case of a platform issue, we\'ll post a notice on our status site at status.capgo.app to quickly communicate the impact and status. You don\'t need to submit a support ticket for ongoing platform issues. Instead, monitor the status page for the latest updates and information.': 'Page/area: Support / premium support page or footer support section. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page support-policy.astro. Message key `support_policy_proactive_monitoring_desc` (Support Policy Proactive Monitoring Desc).',
  'In every scenario above, your app remains usable with the last installed version, and updates are simply skipped until service resumes.': 'Page/area: Support / premium support page or footer support section. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page support-policy.astro. Message key `support_policy_service_disruption_outro` (Support Policy Service Disruption Outro).',
  'In every update mode, if the plugin cannot get an answer from the update service within 3 seconds, it cancels the request and opens the app normally.': 'Page/area: Support / premium support page or footer support section. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page support-policy.astro. Message key `support_policy_service_disruption_timeout` (Support Policy Service Disruption Timeout).',
  'In Finance, Every Second Counts': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page solutions/fintech.astro. Message key `solutions_fintech_reality_title` (Solutions Fintech Reality Title).',
  'In fintech, a security bug can cost millions. You need the ability to fix it in minutes, not days.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Seen in: page solutions/fintech.astro. Message key `solutions_fintech_hero_subtitle` (Solutions Fintech Hero Subtitle).',
  'In Healthcare, Delays Can Be Dangerous': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page solutions/healthcare.astro. Message key `solutions_healthcare_reality_title` (Solutions Healthcare Reality Title).',
