  'Most engagements fall into one of four buckets: custom Capacitor plugin development, Capacitor version upgrades, Cordova-to-Capacitor migrations, and Ionic Enterprise SDK migrations. We also help teams integrate live updates, debug production native issues, and audit existing apps. Scope ranges from two-week fixed-price projects to multi-month retainers — every project starts with a free discovery call so we can understand your scope and goals before putting together a proposal.': 'Page/area: Consulting services page. Role: FAQ question or answer. Seen in: page consulting.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `consulting_faq_a1` (Consulting FAQ A1).',
  'Most mobile tools try to make Apple\'s process nicer. We skip it. Capgo is the shortcut between your web code and your users: open source, fast, and built so teams ship instead of waiting.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: component Manifesto.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `manifesto_home_for_developers` (Manifesto Home For Developers).',
