  'No setup fees, ever. All our pricing is transparent and includes everything you need to get started. All plans consist of a base plan price plus credit usage for any usage beyond your plan limits. Unlike other platforms in this space, we don\'t hide any costs - what you see is what you pay.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: component pricing/Faq.astro. Message key `are_there_any_setup_fees_answer` (Are There Any Setup Fees Answer).',
  'No storage costs. No hidden fees. Just build minutes.': 'Page/area: Capgo Builder / native cloud build product page. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Message key `native_build_pricing_subtitle` (Native Build Pricing Subtitle).',
