  'No Xcode required': 'Page/area: Capgo Builder / native cloud build product page. Role: Short UI label or navigation item. Message key `native_build_comparison_xcode` (Native Build Comparison Xcode).',
  'No, hours don\'t roll over to the next month. The retainer ensures we\'re available and prioritize your requests when you need help. Think of it as insurance for your app.': 'Page/area: Homepage problem/solution section. Role: FAQ question or answer. Seen in: page premium-support.astro. Message key `ps_faq_a2` (Ps FAQ A2).',
  'No, we do not offer discounts at this time.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: component pricing/Faq.astro. Message key `no_discounts_available_at_this_time` (No Discounts Available At This Time).',
  'No, we do not offer PPP at this time.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: component pricing/Faq.astro. Message key `no_ppp_available_at_this_time` (No Ppp Available At This Time).',
  'No! Premium Support is available to any company with a Capacitor app, whether you use Capgo or not.': 'Page/area: Homepage problem/solution section. Role: FAQ question or answer. Seen in: page premium-support.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `ps_faq_a5` (Ps FAQ A5).',
  'No. All dependencies should be installed locally before you run the build command. We only receive what you upload - no access to your Git repos, npm registries, or private packages.': 'Page/area: Capgo Builder / native cloud build product page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `native_build_faq2_a` (Native Build Faq2 A).',
  'No. Capgo can send the generated web build folder: HTML, CSS, JavaScript, assets, and pure-JavaScript package changes bundled into that output. Changes to capacitor.config.ts, native plugin configuration, native package installs or upgrades, and anything that must update the iOS or Android project through npx cap sync or npx cap copy require a native app release.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: component pricing/Faq.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `capacitor_config_changes_answer` (Capacitor Config Changes Answer).',
  'No. Each bundle is counted once for storage, regardless of the delivery regions it serves. Capgo bandwidth counts user-device downloads that are not served from the edge cache. Cache-served deliveries do not count against your Capgo bandwidth usage.': 'Page/area: Enterprise product/pricing page. Role: FAQ question or answer. Seen in: page enterprise.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `enterprise_faq_replication_a` (Enterprise FAQ Replication A).',
  'No. In most migrations, your web UI and business logic stay the same. We focus on the native layer, plugins, and build pipeline.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Message key `solutions_cordova_to_capacitor_faq1_a` (Solutions Cordova To Capacitor Faq1 A).',
  'No. The CLI uploads the build inputs from the machine or CI job where it runs. Private dependencies should already be installed before the build command starts.': 'Page/area: Capgo Builder / native cloud build product page. Role: FAQ question or answer. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `native_build_builder_faq_repo_a` (Native Build Builder FAQ Repo A).',
  'No. They complement each other. Live Updates for JS, CSS, and assets. Builder when native code, plugins, permissions, icons, or SDKs need a new signed binary.': 'Page/area: Capgo Builder / native cloud build product page. Role: FAQ question or answer. Seen in: page native-build.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `native_build_v2_faq_a7` (Native Build V2 FAQ A7).',
  'No. Use live updates for JavaScript, CSS, and asset changes that do not require store review. Use Capgo Builder when native code, plugins, permissions, icons, SDKs, or store binaries change.': 'Page/area: Capgo Builder / native cloud build product page. Role: FAQ question or answer. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `native_build_builder_faq_live_updates_a` (Native Build Builder FAQ Live Updates A).',
  'No. We focus on specialist work where deep Capacitor and native expertise is the differentiator — custom plugins, version upgrades, migrations, and production rescue. For greenfield app development, we can recommend trusted partners who focus on full product builds.': 'Page/area: Consulting services page. Role: FAQ question or answer. Seen in: page consulting.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `consulting_faq_a2` (Consulting FAQ A2).',
