  'The AI can only prepare a useful mobile handoff when it understands the actual source, build output, assets, and native assumptions of the current app.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/webapp-to-mobile.astro. Message key `solutions_webapp_to_mobile_source_lead` (Solutions Webapp To Mobile Source Lead).',
  'The AI cannot finish the store release alone. It can still prepare the repo and leave a precise checklist for the native release step.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/webapp-to-mobile.astro. Message key `solutions_webapp_to_mobile_cap_lead` (Solutions Webapp To Mobile Cap Lead).',
  'The AI should separate web-layer changes from native-store work, then document which future updates can move through release channels after the first app is installed.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Message key `solutions_webapp_to_mobile_cap3_desc` (Solutions Webapp To Mobile Cap3 Desc).',
