  'The app checks Capgo in the background, downloads the bundle, and applies it on next launch with rollback protection.': 'Page/area: Homepage marketing copy. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: component HowItWorks.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `home_users_get_update_desc` (Home Users Get Update Desc).',
