  'The basics:': 'Page/area: Appflow comparison / migration marketing copy. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page ionic-appflow.astro. Message key `appflow_migration_basics_title` (Appflow Migration Basics Title). | Page/area: Capawesome comparison page. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page capwesome.astro. Message key `capwesome_migration_basics_title` (Capwesome Migration Basics Title).',
