  'The exact flag, file or setting to change, copy-paste ready.': 'Page/area: Capgo Builder / native cloud build product page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page native-build.astro. Message key `native_build_v2_aidebug_p2_d` (Native Build V2 Aidebug P2 D).',
  'The fact it\'s a family business makes me trust it MORE, not less. These folks aren\'t going to rugpull us.': 'Page/area: Capacitor live-update alternatives comparison page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page alternatives.astro. Message key `alternatives_testimonial_4` (Alternatives Testimonial 4).',
  'The Fastest Way to Test Mobile Apps': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page solutions/beta-testing.astro. Message key `solutions_beta_testing_hero_title` (Solutions Beta Testing Hero Title).',
  'The final output should state what the AI changed, what it could not do in the builder, and what a human or release service must handle next.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Message key `solutions_webapp_to_mobile_cap4_desc` (Solutions Webapp To Mobile Cap4 Desc).',
  'The Fintech Reality': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: UI label. Seen in: page solutions/fintech.astro. Message key `solutions_fintech_reality_label` (Solutions Fintech Reality Label).',
  'The first binary is only the start. Every onboarding tweak, pricing copy change, or bug fix should not wait for another full app review.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Message key `solutions_lovable_to_mobile_pain3_desc` (Solutions Lovable To Mobile Pain3 Desc).',
  'The first binary is only the start. The AI should define what belongs in web-layer updates, what requires a new native build, and how production, staging, and preview updates stay separated.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Message key `solutions_webapp_to_mobile_pain3_desc` (Solutions Webapp To Mobile Pain3 Desc).',
  'The fix is ready before the release process is.': 'Page/area: Enterprise product/pricing page. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page enterprise.astro. Message key `enterprise_pain_incident_title` (Enterprise Pain Incident Title).',
  'The fix was ready, but they had to experience the bug first. For critical issues, that\'s unacceptable.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/direct-updates.astro. Message key `solutions_direct_problem_step3_desc` (Solutions Direct Problem Step3 Desc).',
  'The following Goods cannot be returned:': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page return.astro. Message key `non_returnable_goods` (Non Returnable Goods).',
  'The following Service Level Agreement, which is incorporated into and forms part of the Subscription Agreement between Capgo ("Capgo") and Customer (the "Agreement"), will apply to the Services for Enterprise Customers specified in an Order Form during the applicable Subscription Term:': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page sla.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `sla_intro` (SLA Intro).',
  'The following terms are applicable for any products that You purchased with Us.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page return.astro. Message key `terms_applicable` (Terms Applicable).',
  'The free trial got me started. Now I pay $12/month and ship updates daily. Best tool in my stack.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/solo-developers.astro. Message key `solutions_solo_testimonial2` (Solutions Solo Testimonial2).',
  'The goal is not another tutorial-only project. It is a mobile release loop you can keep using after launch.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/lovable-vibecoding-to-mobile.astro. Message key `solutions_lovable_to_mobile_workflow_lead` (Solutions Lovable To Mobile Workflow Lead).',
  'The goal is not one-click automation. The goal is a clear, reviewable handoff that a developer or release service can continue from.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/webapp-to-mobile.astro. Message key `solutions_webapp_to_mobile_workflow_lead` (Solutions Webapp To Mobile Workflow Lead).',
  'The goal of Capgo is to operate live updates reliably, not to track individual users across apps, websites, or Capgo customers. Capgo uses the data needed for update eligibility, monthly active device de-duplication, support, abuse prevention, and operational reliability.': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dp.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `data_policy_goal` (Data Policy Goal).',
  'The Goods were purchased in the last 14 days': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page return.astro. Message key `purchase_timeframe` (Purchase Timeframe).',
  'The group of data subjects affected by the processing of their data under this agreement includes end-users of the controller\'s apps or services that make use of the service provided by the processor.': 'Page/area: Data Processing Agreement legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dpa.astro. Message key `dpa_privacy_security_7` (DPA Privacy Security 7).',
  'The hard part is not compiling Swift. It is Xcode, certificates, provisioning profiles, App Store Connect keys, and one laptop becoming the release gate. Capgo Builder gives Capacitor teams a CLI-first path to signed iOS builds from anywhere.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/build-without-mac.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_build_without_mac_lead` (Solutions Build Without Mac Lead).',
