  'The Hidden Cost of Slow Testing': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/pr-preview.astro. Message key `solutions_pr_real_cost` (Solutions Pr Real Cost).',
  'The hidden work': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: UI label. Seen in: page solutions/build-without-mac.astro. Message key `solutions_build_without_mac_normal_label` (Solutions Build Without Mac Normal Label).',
  'The honest differences': 'Page/area: Capawesome comparison page. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page capwesome.astro. Message key `capwesome_differences_title` (Capwesome Differences Title).',
  'The information contained on the Service is for general information purposes only.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page disclaimer.astro. Message key `disclaimer_text` (Disclaimer Text).',
  'The information given by the Service is for general guidance on matters of interest only. Even if the Company takes every precaution to insure that the content of the Service is both current and accurate, errors can occur. Plus, given the changing nature of laws, rules and regulations, there may be delays, omissions or inaccuracies in the information contained on the Service.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page disclaimer.astro. Message key `errors_and_omissions_disclaimer_text` (Errors And Omissions Disclaimer Text).',
