  'the last successfully installed update remains on each device, but no new updates are downloaded.': 'HTML text fragment from a longer Capgo UI string (parent key `support_policy_service_disruption_if_billing_stopped`). Page/area: Support / premium support page or footer support section. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page support-policy.astro. Message key `support_policy_service_disruption_if_billing_stopped` (Support Policy Service Disruption If Billing Stopped).',
  'The laws of the Country, excluding its conflicts of law rules, shall govern this Agreement and your use of the Application. Your use of the Application may also be subject to other local, state, national, or international laws.': 'Page/area: End User License Agreement legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page eula.astro. Message key `eula_governing_law_text` (EULA Governing Law Text).',
  'The laws of the Country, excluding its conflicts of law rules, shall govern this Terms and Your use of the Service. Your use of the Application may also be subject to other local, state, national, or international laws.': 'Page/area: Terms of Service legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page tos.astro. Message key `tos_governing_law_text` (Terms of Service Governing Law Text).',
  'The license that is granted to You by the Company is solely for your personal, non-commercial purposes strictly in accordance with the terms of this Agreement.': 'Page/area: End User License Agreement legal page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page eula.astro. Message key `eula_license_scope_text_3` (EULA License Scope Text 3).',
  'The limits that matter most are clear before the call.': 'Page/area: Enterprise product/pricing page. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page enterprise.astro. Message key `enterprise_limits_title` (Enterprise Limits Title).',
  'The longer you wait, the more expensive each iOS/Android update becomes.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Seen in: page solutions/cordova-to-capacitor.astro. Message key `solutions_cordova_to_capacitor_reality_subtitle` (Solutions Cordova To Capacitor Reality Subtitle).',
  'The main relief users mention is not just no Mac. It is that the release process becomes repeatable: init once, request a build, stream logs, and stop passing signing files around the team.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/build-without-mac.astro. Message key `solutions_build_without_mac_quote_text` (Solutions Build Without Mac Quote Text).',
  'The migration from Appflow took 2 hours. We went from $499/month to $12/month. Same features, better DX.': 'Page/area: Capacitor live-update alternatives comparison page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page alternatives.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `alternatives_testimonial_1` (Alternatives Testimonial 1).',
  'The Mini-App Store Model': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section or page heading. Message key `solutions_white_label_miniapp_title` (Solutions White Label Miniapp Title).',
  'The more clients you manage, the less you pay per app. Discounts up to 40% off.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/agencies.astro. Message key `solutions_agencies_perk1_desc` (Solutions Agencies Perk1 Desc).',
  'The normal iOS path asks you to understand Apple signing before you can even learn if your app builds. Capgo turns that into an interactive setup and one build request.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/build-without-mac.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_build_without_mac_cli_lead` (Solutions Build Without Mac CLI Lead).',
  'The open source backend was the deciding factor. We needed to audit the security ourselves for compliance.': 'Page/area: Capawesome comparison page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page capwesome.astro. Message key `capwesome_testimonial_1` (Capwesome Testimonial 1).',
  'The other guys': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Short UI label or navigation item. Seen in: page solutions/startups.astro. Message key `solutions_startups_adv4_competitor` (Solutions Startups Adv4 Competitor).',
  'The other options (and when to pick them)': 'Page/area: Capacitor live-update alternatives comparison page. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page alternatives.astro. Message key `alternatives_other_options_title` (Alternatives Other Options Title).',
  'The pain repeats every time mobile fixes depend on the store.': 'Page/area: Enterprise product/pricing page. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page enterprise.astro. Message key `enterprise_pain_title` (Enterprise Pain Title).',
  'The parties agree that user is the data controller and that Capgo is its data processor in relation to service data that is processed in the course of providing the service.': 'Page/area: Data Processing Agreement legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dpa.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `dpa_definitions_4` (DPA Definitions 4).',
  'The platform owner reviews and promotes to production': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Message key `solutions_white_label_miniapp_step6` (Solutions White Label Miniapp Step6).',
  'The point users repeat is control. They want tenant 42 to get its urgent fix today without moving tenant 1, tenant 7, and every app store listing at the same time.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/white-label.astro. Message key `solutions_white_label_quote_text` (Solutions White Label Quote Text).',
