  'The Problem': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Short UI label or navigation item. Seen in: page solutions/build-without-mac.astro, page solutions/direct-updates.astro, page solutions/lovable-vibecoding-to-mobile.astro. Message key `solutions_the_problem` (Solutions The Problem).',
  'The Problem with Background Updates': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/direct-updates.astro. Message key `solutions_direct_background_problem` (Solutions Direct Background Problem).',
