  'The prototype stops at the browser': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section or page heading. Message key `solutions_lovable_to_mobile_pain1_title` (Solutions Lovable To Mobile Pain1 Title).',
  'The purpose of Capgo is to deliver Capacitor live updates without advertising tracking, hardware-derived identifiers, or tracking users across apps, websites, or Capgo customers.': 'Page/area: Data Processing Agreement legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dpa.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `dpa_privacy_security_4` (DPA Privacy Security 4).',
  'The QSR Reality': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: UI label. Seen in: page solutions/qsr.astro. Message key `solutions_qsr_reality_label` (Solutions Qsr Reality Label).',
  'The questions enterprise teams ask before choosing Capgo.': 'Page/area: Enterprise product/pricing page. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page enterprise.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `enterprise_faq_title` (Enterprise FAQ Title).',
  'The Real Cost of Slow Updates': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/production-updates.astro. Message key `solutions_real_cost` (Solutions Real Cost).',
  'The real pain came during crunch weeks. When multiple PRs needed testing simultaneously, QA had to constantly reinstall different TestFlight builds. Testers got confused about which version they were running. Bugs got reported on already-fixed code.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/pr-preview.astro. Message key `solutions_pr_case_para2` (Solutions Pr Case Para2).',
