  'The reality:': 'Page/area: Capacitor live-update alternatives comparison page. Role: UI label. Seen in: page alternatives.astro. Message key `alternatives_appflow_reality_label` (Alternatives Appflow Reality Label).',
  'The repeated customer point is simple: Lovable made the prototype possible, but Capgo made it feel like a product. The release loop is what keeps the app alive after the first store build.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/lovable-vibecoding-to-mobile.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_lovable_to_mobile_quote_text` (Solutions Lovable To Mobile Quote Text).',
