  'The update system is designed to fail safe. If Capgo is unavailable, the app keeps running and no user-facing freeze is introduced by the update check.': 'Page/area: Support / premium support page or footer support section. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page support-policy.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `support_policy_service_disruption_intro` (Support Policy Service Disruption Intro).',
