  'Their engineering team pushed the fix in 23 minutes. But with background updates, over 40,000 users who opened the app during those 23 minutes would still hit the bug on their current session. At their average order value of $47, that represented over $1.8 million in at-risk revenue.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/direct-updates.astro. Message key `solutions_direct_case_para2` (Solutions Direct Case Para2).',
