  'These prompts are designed to produce usable outputs (tables, checklists, plans), not vague advice.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/cordova-to-capacitor-ai.astro. Message key `solutions_cordova_to_capacitor_ai_section_prompts_body` (Solutions Cordova To Capacitor Ai Section Prompts Body).',
