  'They encounter the exact issue you fixed. Frustration builds. Maybe they leave a 1-star review.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/direct-updates.astro. Message key `solutions_direct_problem_step2_desc` (Solutions Direct Problem Step2 Desc).',
