  'They integrate directly with your git provider. If you prefer everything connected and don\'t mind the vendor lock-in, that\'s convenient.': 'Page/area: Capawesome comparison page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page capwesome.astro. Message key `capwesome_when_better_git` (Capwesome When Better Git).',
