  'This isn\'t a "we\'re better at everything" page. The Capacitor ecosystem is genuinely better with multiple healthy options. Let\'s talk about the actual differences.': 'Page/area: Capawesome comparison page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page capwesome.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `capwesome_respect_p2` (Capwesome Respect P2).',
  'This matters if you got burned by a proprietary service shutting down (looking at you, Appflow).': 'Page/area: Appflow comparison / migration marketing copy. Role: Supporting note or footnote. Seen in: page ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `appflow_opensource_note` (Appflow Opensource Note).',
