  'To qualify for the Bug Bounty program, your report must meet ALL of the following requirements:': 'Page/area: Bug bounty program page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page bug-bounty.astro. Message key `bug_bounty_requirements_intro` (Bug Bounty Requirements Intro).',
  'To request a Service Credit, Customer must send an email to Capgo at support@capgo.app within thirty (30) days of the end of the month in which the Uptime Commitment was not met. Customer must include either its account ID or registered email address, and the previously reported dates and times that there was no Service Availability. If Capgo confirms that Customer is eligible for a Service Credit, Capgo will issue a credit to Customer\'s account within thirty (30) days. Service Credits are not refunds, cannot be exchanged into a cash amount, and may only be used against future billing charges. Except as set forth in Section 4 below, the Service Credits shall be Customer\'s sole and exclusive remedy, and Capgo\'s sole and exclusive liability, for any failure by Capgo to meet the Uptime Commitment.': 'Page/area: Pricing page or plan calculator UI. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page sla.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `credit_requests_payment_desc` (Credit Requests Payment Desc).',
  'To respond to law enforcement requests and as required by applicable law, court order, or governmental regulations.': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page dp.astro. Message key `data_policy_ccpa_use_of_info_4` (Data Policy CCPA Use Of Info 4).',
