  'Upload to TestFlight or collect an IPA, then keep shipping JS and asset fixes with Capgo live updates.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_build_without_mac_workflow4_desc` (Solutions Build Without Mac Workflow4 Desc).',
