  'Upon termination of this Agreement, You shall cease all use of the Application and delete all copies of the Application from your Device.': 'Page/area: End User License Agreement legal page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page eula.astro. Message key `eula_term_and_termination_text_3` (EULA Term And Termination Text 3).',
