  'When a dosage calculation bug could harm patients, you can\'t wait for app store approval.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Seen in: page solutions/healthcare.astro. Message key `solutions_healthcare_hero_subtitle` (Solutions Healthcare Hero Subtitle).',
  'When a production bug hits a Capacitor app, waiting 24–48 hours for App Store or Play review is too slow. Teams need a fix out today, with a rollback if it misses.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page affiliate.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `affiliate_problem` (Affiliate Problem).',
  'When a web-layer bug is live, ship the fix through Capgo instead of waiting days for app store approval. Users get the update in the background while native changes stay in the normal review path.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Supporting description paragraph or meta description. Seen in: component GetStarted.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `instant_updates_for_capacitor_apps_description` (Instant Updates For Capacitor Apps Description).',
  'When AI can generate features in minutes, your deployment process shouldn\'t take days. Ship as fast as you can think.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/solo-developers.astro. Message key `solutions_solo_ai_benefit3_desc` (Solutions Solo Ai Benefit3 Desc).',
  'When an application works too slow or gets down (even for a few minutes), it can damage users\' satisfaction and decrease the revenue. To avoid such situations, review the code to find areas for improvement.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page consulting.astro. Message key `when_down_review` (When Down Review).',
  'When auditors ask \'what code is running on patient devices?\', you\'ll have the answer.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Seen in: page solutions/healthcare.astro. Message key `solutions_healthcare_audit_subtitle` (Solutions Healthcare Audit Subtitle).',
  'When auditors ask \'who deployed what, when, and why?\' you need answers. Not excuses.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Message key `solutions_enterprise_problem3_desc` (Solutions Enterprise Problem3 Desc).',
  'When Black Friday hits and your cart breaks, you can\'t wait 5 days for Apple. Fix it. Now.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Seen in: page solutions/ecommerce.astro. Message key `solutions_ecommerce_hero_subtitle` (Solutions Ecommerce Hero Subtitle).',
  'When developing a CapacitorJS app as a beginner, it\'s good to have an experienced consultant by your side.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page consulting.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `when_developing_a_capacitorjs_app_as_a_beginner_it_s_good_to_have_an_experienced_consultant_by_your_side` (When Developing A Capacitorjs App As A Beginner It S Good To Have An Experienced Consultant By Your Side).',
  'When do I get paid?': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: FAQ question or answer. Seen in: page affiliate.astro. Message key `affiliate_faq_q1` (Affiliate FAQ Q1).',
  'When doctors can\'t trust your app, they stop using it. One bug can destroy years of relationship building.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/healthcare.astro. Message key `solutions_healthcare_pain3_desc` (Solutions Healthcare Pain3 Desc).',
