  'When lunch rush hits and your ordering app crashes, you can\'t wait until next week for a fix.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/qsr.astro. Message key `solutions_qsr_pain4_desc` (Solutions Qsr Pain4 Desc).',
  'When patient safety is at risk, deploy the fix immediately. No app store review. No waiting.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/healthcare.astro. Message key `solutions_healthcare_sol1_desc` (Solutions Healthcare Sol1 Desc).',
  'When Production Updates Shine': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/production-updates.astro. Message key `solutions_when_to_use` (Solutions When To Use).',
  'When regulators ask how you respond to security incidents, \'we wait for Apple\' isn\'t an acceptable answer.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/fintech.astro. Message key `solutions_fintech_pain4_desc` (Solutions Fintech Pain4 Desc).',
  'When something goes wrong, you need to know what happened on THAT specific device. Server logs tell you what you sent - device logs tell you what actually happened.': 'Page/area: Capawesome comparison page. Role: Supporting note or footnote. Seen in: page capwesome.astro. Message key `capwesome_diff_logs_note` (Capwesome Diff Logs Note).',
  'When the project ends, transfer everything to the client with one click. No missing credentials. No broken processes.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/agencies.astro. Message key `solutions_agencies_sol3_desc` (Solutions Agencies Sol3 Desc).',
  'When the project ends, transferring everything to the client takes weeks and still goes wrong.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/agencies.astro. Message key `solutions_agencies_pain6_desc` (Solutions Agencies Pain6 Desc).',
  'When Things Go Wrong With Mobile Apps': 'Page/area: Homepage problem/solution section. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page premium-support.astro. Message key `ps_when_things_go_wrong` (Ps When Things Go Wrong).',
  'When to Use Direct Updates': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page solutions/direct-updates.astro. Message key `solutions_direct_when_title` (Solutions Direct When Title).',
  'When You access the Service by or through a mobile device, We may collect certain information automatically, including, but not limited to, the type of mobile device You use, Your mobile device unique ID, the IP address of Your mobile device, Your mobile operating system, the type of mobile Internet browser You use, unique device identifiers and other diagnostic data.': 'Page/area: Privacy policy legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page privacy.astro. Message key `privacy_usage_data_mobile` (Privacy Usage Data Mobile).',
  'When You create an account with Us, You must provide Us information that is accurate, complete, and current at all times. Failure to do so constitutes a breach of the Terms, which may result in immediate termination of Your account on Our Service.': 'Page/area: Terms of Service legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page tos.astro. Message key `tos_user_accounts_text_1` (Terms of Service User Accounts Text 1).',
  'When you factor in developer wait time, QA blocked time, and delayed feedback, each PR costs an average of $340 in lost productivity.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/pr-preview.astro. Message key `solutions_pr_cost_explanation` (Solutions Pr Cost Explanation).',
  'When you find a bug on Monday, fix it on Monday. Not next week when Apple finally approves your update.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/startups.astro. Message key `solutions_startups_adv3_desc` (Solutions Startups Adv3 Desc).',
  'When you find a vulnerability, fix it immediately. No app store review. No waiting. Your users are protected in hours, not days.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/fintech.astro. Message key `solutions_fintech_sol1_desc` (Solutions Fintech Sol1 Desc).',
  'When you hit a problem, contact us via email or Discord. Describe the issue.': 'Page/area: Homepage problem/solution section. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page premium-support.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `ps_step2_desc` (Ps Step2 Desc).',
  'When you push a bad update, there\'s no one to roll it back for you. You\'re on your own.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/solo-developers.astro. Message key `solutions_solo_pain5_desc` (Solutions Solo Pain5 Desc).',
  'When you push a fix, it\'s truly fixed. Users don\'t experience the bug \'one more time\' while waiting for the next launch. The moment they open the app after your fix, they get the fixed version.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/direct-updates.astro. Message key `solutions_direct_benefit2_desc` (Solutions Direct Benefit2 Desc).',
  'When you use our service, Capgo collects and processes service data needed to operate live updates. You entrust us with that data and we take that trust to heart. The privacy of your service data is a big deal to us.': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dp.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `data_policy_ownership_intro` (Data Policy Ownership Intro).',
  'When you work on a new feature, create an issue and discuss with other contributors': 'HTML text fragment from a longer Capgo UI string (parent key `create_an_issue_and_discuss_before_working_on_a_new_feature`). Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page contributing.astro. Message key `create_an_issue_and_discuss_before_working_on_a_new_feature` (Create An Issue And Discuss Before Working On A New Feature).',
  'When you work on a new feature, create an issue and discuss with other contributors <em>before</em> you start working on the feature; we appreciate all contributions, but not all proposed features are getting accepted. We don\'t want you to spend hours working on a code that might not be accepted.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page contributing.astro. Message key `create_an_issue_and_discuss_before_working_on_a_new_feature` (Create An Issue And Discuss Before Working On A New Feature).',
  'When you work on a new feature, create an issue and discuss with other contributors before you start working on the feature; we appreciate all contributions, but not all proposed features are getting accepted. We don\'t want you to spend hours working on a code that might not be accepted.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page contributing.astro. Message key `create_an_issue_and_discuss_before_working_on_a_new_feature` (Create An Issue And Discuss Before Working On A New Feature).',
