  'You may be subject to additional terms and conditions that apply when You use or purchase other Company\'s services, which the Company will provide to You at the time of such use or purchase.': 'Page/area: End User License Agreement legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page eula.astro. Message key `eula_entire_agreement_text_2` (EULA Entire Agreement Text 2).',
  'You may cancel Your Subscription renewal either through Your Account settings page or by contacting the Company. You will not receive a refund for the fees You already paid for Your current Subscription period and You will be able to access the Service until the end of Your current Subscription period.': 'Page/area: Terms of Service legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page tos.astro. Message key `tos_subscriptions_cancellations_text_1` (Terms of Service Subscriptions Cancellations Text 1).',
  'You may exercise Your rights of access, rectification, cancellation and opposition by contacting Us. Please note that we may ask You to verify Your identity before responding to such requests. If You make a request, We will try our best to respond to You as soon as possible.': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dp.astro. Message key `data_policy_gdpr_exercising_rights_contact` (Data Policy GDPR Exercising Rights Contact).',
  'You may not make network connections to any users, hosts, or networks unless you have permission to communicate with them. Prohibited activities include:': 'Page/area: Acceptable Use Policy legal page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page aup.astro. Message key `aup_no_network_abuse_desc` (Acceptable Use Policy No Network Abuse Desc).',
  'You may not use as a username the name of another person or entity or that is not lawfully available for use, a name or trademark that is subject to any rights of another person or entity other than You without appropriate authorization, or a name that is otherwise offensive, vulgar or obscene.': 'Page/area: Terms of Service legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page tos.astro. Message key `tos_user_accounts_text_4` (Terms of Service User Accounts Text 4).',
  'You may not use the Services to violate the security or integrity of any network, computer or communications system, software application, or network or computing device (each, a \'System\'). Prohibited activities include:': 'Page/area: Acceptable Use Policy legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page aup.astro. Message key `aup_no_security_violations_desc` (Acceptable Use Policy No Security Violations Desc).',
  'You may not use, or encourage, promote, facilitate or instruct others to use, the Services or Capgo Site for any illegal, harmful, fraudulent, infringing or offensive use, or to transmit, store, display, distribute or otherwise make available content that is illegal, harmful, fraudulent, infringing or offensive. Prohibited activities or content include:': 'Page/area: Acceptable Use Policy legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page aup.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `aup_no_illegal_use_desc` (Acceptable Use Policy No Illegal Use Desc).',
  'You may only use the Application on a Device that You own or control and as permitted by the Application Store\'s terms and conditions.': 'Page/area: End User License Agreement legal page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page eula.astro. Message key `eula_license_scope_text_2` (EULA License Scope Text 2).',
  'You means the individual accessing or using the Service, or the company, or other legal entity on behalf of which such individual is accessing or using the Service, as applicable.': 'Page/area: Terms of Service legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page tos.astro. Message key `tos_definition_you` (Terms of Service Definition You).',
  'You means the individual accessing the Service, or the company, or other legal entity on behalf of which such individual is accessing or using the Service, as applicable.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page disclaimer.astro, page return.astro. Message key `you_definition` (You Definition).',
  'You Miss Out on New Capabilities': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page solutions/cordova-to-capacitor.astro. Message key `solutions_cordova_to_capacitor_pain4_title` (Solutions Cordova To Capacitor Pain4 Title).',
