  'You must identify the exact file and line number in our GitHub repository where the vulnerability exists': 'Page/area: Bug bounty program page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page bug-bounty.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `bug_bounty_requirement_1` (Bug Bounty Requirement 1).',
  'You must include a clear description of the vulnerability and its potential impact': 'Page/area: Bug bounty program page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page bug-bounty.astro. Message key `bug_bounty_requirement_3` (Bug Bounty Requirement 3).',
