  'You need a to access to specific native API and the right plugin don\'t exist. We can develop it for you or support you with it.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page consulting.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `you_need_a_to_access_to_specific_native_api_and_the_right_plugin_don_t_exist_we_can_develop_it_for_you_or_support_you_with_it` (You Need A To Access To Specific Native API And The Right Plugin Don T Exist We Can Develop It For You Or Support You With It).',
  'You Need It Most': 'Page/area: Homepage problem/solution section. Role: Short UI label or navigation item. Seen in: page premium-support.astro. Message key `ps_hero_title_2` (Ps Hero Title 2).',
  'You need the right Apple Developer team, bundle ID, capabilities, App Store Connect app record, and upload permissions before the first build can succeed.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_build_without_mac_normal1_desc` (Solutions Build Without Mac Normal1 Desc).',
  'You own all right, title, and interest to your app and update data. We obtain no rights from you to that data. We do not collect and analyze personal information to sell advertisements. We don\'t sell or share your service data to advertising companies, and we don\'t abuse your users\' privacy.': 'Page/area: Data Processing Agreement legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dpa.astro. Message key `dpa_privacy_security_3` (DPA Privacy Security 3).',
  'You own all right, title, and interest to your service data. We obtain no rights from you to your service data beyond the rights needed to provide the Capgo service. We will never sell your service data.': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dp.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `data_policy_ownership_rights` (Data Policy Ownership Rights).',
  'You provide certificates, provisioning profiles, keystores, and store credentials through CLI flags or environment variables. Teams usually source them from their CI secret manager.': 'Page/area: Capgo Builder / native cloud build product page. Role: FAQ question or answer. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `native_build_builder_faq_signing_a` (Native Build Builder FAQ Signing A).',
  'You quoted a fixed price. Now you\'re eating the cost of every bug fix because app store reviews eat your margins.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/agencies.astro. Message key `solutions_agencies_pain4_desc` (Solutions Agencies Pain4 Desc).',
  'You read the raw logs yourself and search the errors.': 'Page/area: Capgo Builder / native cloud build product page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page native-build.astro. Message key `native_build_v2_comp_ai_diy` (Native Build V2 Comp Ai Diy).',
  'You represent and warrant that (i) You are not located in a country that is subject to the United States government embargo, or that has been designated by the United States government as a "terrorist supporting" country, and (ii) You are not listed on any United States government list of prohibited or restricted parties.': 'Page/area: End User License Agreement legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page eula.astro. Message key `eula_us_legal_compliance_text` (EULA Us Legal Compliance Text). | Page/area: Terms of Service legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page tos.astro. Message key `tos_us_legal_compliance_text` (Terms of Service Us Legal Compliance Text).',
  'You represent that you are over the age of 18. The Company does not permit those under 18 to use the Service.': 'Page/area: Terms of Service legal page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page tos.astro. Message key `tos_acknowledgment_text_4` (Terms of Service Acknowledgment Text 4).',
  'You shall provide the Company with accurate and complete billing information including full name, address, state, zip code, telephone number, and a valid payment method information.': 'Page/area: Terms of Service legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page tos.astro. Message key `tos_subscriptions_billing_text_1` (Terms of Service Subscriptions Billing Text 1).',
