  'You\'re building a company, not a deployment pipeline. Ship features daily without the DevOps overhead.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Seen in: page solutions/startups.astro. Message key `solutions_startups_hero_subtitle` (Solutions Startups Hero Subtitle).',
